**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-types/
.git/
.github/
tests/

# client/ is NOT excluded, and the blank line above is not an accident.
#
# It was excluded for eleven phases, which is the mechanical reason the
# published image contained no application (§13.27, register row 18): the
# Dockerfile could not have copied the client even if it had tried, because the
# build context did not contain it. The heavy parts are already excluded by the
# node_modules and dist patterns above, and dist being excluded is deliberate —
# the client is built inside the image, so a stale build on the host must not
# leak into it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
